      "text": "# App code \u2014 call via LiteLLM\nfrom openai import OpenAI\nclient = OpenAI(\n  base_url=\"http://litellm.<ns>.svc/v1\",\n  api_key=\"<key>\")\nresp = client.chat.completions.create(\n  model=\"qwen2.5-7b\",\n  messages=[...])",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 106.0,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# App code \u2014 call via LiteLLM\nfrom openai import OpenAI\nclient = OpenAI(\n  base_url=\"http://litellm.<ns>.svc/v1\",\n  api_key=\"<key>\")\nresp = client.chat.completions.create(\n  model=\"qwen2.5-7b\",\n  messages=[...])",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
